.26, 13.98, 14.65], [7.01, 7.57, 8.1, 8.63, 9.13, 9.62, 10.08, 10.53, 10.97]], [[7.05, 10.47, 12.9, 14.79, 16.34, 17.65, 18.8, 19.8, 20.71], [7.05, 10.33, 12.7, 14.55, 16.08, 17.37, 18.5, 19.5, 20.39], [7.05, 10.01, 12.21, 13.97, 15.42, 16.67, 17.76, 18.73, 19.6], [7.05, 9.73, 11.77, 13.43, 14.82, 16.02, 17.07, 18.01, 18.86], [7.05, 9.27, 11.05, 12.53, 13.8, 14.91, 15.89, 16.77, 17.58], [7.05, 8.93, 10.5, 11.83, 12.98, 14.01, 14.93, 15.76, 16.51], [7.05, 8.41, 9.6, 10.66, 11.61, 12.47, 13.26, 13.98, 14.65], [7.01, 7.57, 8.1, 8.63, 9.13, 9.62, 10.08, 10.53, 10.97]]], "note": "engine_bus.py: dB to add to every engine layer (the chip plays them at the dry route in + out dB): the waveshaper + EQs measured on the layers; [rpm][f28][amount]"}, "ws": {"rpm": [2000, 2500], "pos": [0, 0.8, 0, 1], "posRate": 2, "neg": [0, 0.5, 0, 1], "negRate": 0.5, "amountCurveE": 2.0, "amountCurveT": 7}}, "ignition": {"snd": "IGNITION_EXOTIC_MASTER", "pos": "pos1: views 0 / 1 the camera point xfader.camPoint[view] (camera space x right, y up, z back: world = eye + q.x*right + q.y*up - q.z*forward), other views the car", "timerMs": [750, 1000], "rule": "engine state 0 (first update): play the ignition (code 0 dB, 0 cents). After randInt(ignMin, ignMax) ms (inclusive) the voice is stopped: its OnStop kills the playing leaves (no fade) and plays the onStop sound (stop.def) with the OnStop node's summed dB / cents (incl. its rolled randoms) added, unpositioned (centred, no distance: Snd root without posFn); then state 5: the post-start rev (engine.start)", "kaput": {"snd": "IGNITION_KAPUT_MASTER", "note": "state 2 (stall) is never entered by sound.js: not resolved"}, "notes": "sound.js:717-718; ign stop sound.js:716; OnStop sound.js:398-404; pos1 sound.js:639-644"}, "gears": {"gear": "GEARSHIFTS_MASTER", "skip": "GEARSHIFTS_SPECIAL_MASTER", "shiftDelayMs": 30, "pos": "pos0: the car", "rule": "prevGear = 2 at start, shiftSeen = 0. Each update: a pending timer counts down (dt) and fires gearSound(gear) when < 0. When transmission +0x18 (s.shift) differs from shiftSeen: shift < 0 -> gearSound(gear) now (against the previous prevGear); shift > 0 -> timer = shiftDelay (30) ms; then shiftSeen = shift, prevGear = gear (the gear at the edge). gearSound(g): |g - prevGear| <= 1 -> 'gear' when g >= 2 (none for N / R); a jump of more -> 'skip'. The previous gear voice is stopped first. Code 0 dB 0 cents", "notes": "sound.js:819-836; prevGear init sound.js:603"}, "backfire": {"snd": "BACKFIRE_MASTER", "delay": 0.1, "pos": "pos0: the car", "rule": "throttle (vehicle +0x88) == 1.0: armed, timer = backfireDelay*0.01 s (0.1); armed and throttle == 0 and rpm < last frame's rpm: timer -= dt, at <= 0 play (0 dB, 0 cents), disarm", "notes": "sound.js:839-844"}, "horn": {"snd": "MUSTANG_HORN_FIN", "pos": "pos1 (as the ignition)", "rule": "held: play once (0 dB) and keep it (the wave loops); released: stop", "notes": "sound.js:1031-1034"}, "reverse": {"accel": "REVERSE_ACCEL-LOOP_MASTER", "accelDb": 0, "accelCents": 0, "decel": "REVERSE_DECEL_MASTER", "decelDb": 0, "decelCents": 0, "minMph": 10, "pos": "pos1", "rule": "reversing = gear 0 and speed > 1 m/s; mph = speed * 2.237. Not reversing: both stop, t296 = t300 = 0. Throttle <= 0 and mph >= minMph: when t300 >= 0.15 s: t296 = 0, accel stops, decel plays unless already playing (start % of the wave = mph < 40 ? trunc((1 - mph*0.025)*100) : 0); t300 += dt. Throttle > 0: when t296 >= 0.15 s or mph < 6: t300 = 0, decel stops, accel plays unless playing (start % = mph >= minMph ? trunc((min(mph, 40) - minMph) / (40 - minMph) * 100) : 0); t296 += dt. The code start % eats the predelay first, the rest adds to the leaf header start (leaf.st)", "notes": "sound.js:792-815; start offsets sound.js:290-294"}, "roll": {"snd": "TERRAINS_ROAD_PLAYER_MASTER", "material": "MATERIALS_ROAD", "minMph": 10, "vol": {"curve": "LINEAR_RISE", "out": [0.5, 1], "mph": [10, 100]}, "pitch": {"curve": "LINEAR_RISE", "out": [0.8, 2], "mph": [5, 100], "note": "sound.js uses volCurve for the pitch too (pitchCurve = LINEAR_RISE)"}, "pos": "the wheel contact point (wheel +0x170)", "rule": "per wheel on the ground, its own voice. mph = |wheel speed m/s| * 2.237; mph < minMph: stop; else v = clamp(curveRange(curve, vol.out[0], vol.out[1], vol.mph[0], vol.mph[1], mph), out range), pr likewise with pitch.*; code dB = lin2dB(v), cents = trunc(1200*log2(pr)); first play with code start = 25 * k % of the wave (k = the wheel index among the non-null wheels, 0..3), set() afterwards. Off the ground: roll and skid stop. curveRange(c, o0, o1, i0, i1, x) = o0 + (o1 - o0) * curve(x <= i0 ? 0 : x >= i1 ? 1 : (x - i0)/(i1 - i0)). Twin loops: x starts 1 (target 1), every randInt(swap) ms the target flips (0 <-> 1) and the rate becomes 1/randF(xf) per ms (1 when <= 1); x moves to the target linearly; slot 0 gain sin(x*pi/2), slot 1 sin((1-x)*pi/2) (LINEAR_FALL: x, 1-x), added as lin2dB(gain) to the leaf dB", "notes": "sound.js:873-894; twin loop sound.js:322-336, update sound.js:380-383"}, "skids": {"snd": "SKIDS_MASTER", "material": "MATERIALS_ROAD", "min": 0.25, "rate": 5, "pitch": [0.85, 1.15], "gain": {"name": "SKID_GAIN", "def": {"t": 7, "clamp": false, "min": 0, "max": 1, "fx": false, "fy": false, "e": 0.1}}, "global": {"name": "GLOBAL_SKIDS", "dB": 2, "cents": 0}, "pos": "the wheel contact point", "lpf": {"curve": "EXP_RISE_SINE", "range": [8000, 20000, 0], "note": "request LPF (voice filter): not reproducible with bass, ignored here"}, "rule": "per wheel on the ground: sk = wheel +0x208 (0..1). No voice and sk <= min: sm = min; else sm -> sk at rate/s. sm <= min: stop; else ratio = (sm - min) / (1 - min), code dB = lin2dB(SKID_GAIN(ratio)) + global.dB (SKID_GAIN type 7: ratio^0.1), pitch ratio = (pitch[0] + (pitch[1] - pitch[0]) * ratio) * 2^(global.cents/1200), code cents = trunc(1200*log2(that)); first play with code start 25 * k % (k as roll), set() afterwards", "notes": "sound.js:896-908; GLOBAL_SKIDS = car json skids"}, "collisions": {"manager": "PLAYER_CAR_COLLISION_MGR", "partMaterials": {"car_side": "MATERIALS_DEFAULT", "car_roof": "MATERIALS_DEFAULT", "car_undercarriage": "MATERIALS_DEFAULT", "car_wheel": "MATERIALS_DEFAULT"}, "parts": {"car_side": {"name": "PLAYER_CAR_COLLISION_SIDE", "bands": [{"mph": 3, "vol": [0.75, 1], "l": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_NEW_SML_L_MASTER", "r": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_NEW_SML_R_MASTER", "at": null, "front": "DAMAGE_HOOD_INT_HARD"}, {"mph": 8, "vol": [1, 1], "l": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_NEW_MED_L_MASTER", "r": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_NEW_MED_R_MASTER", "at": null, "front": "DAMAGE_HOOD_INT_HARD"}, {"mph": 40, "vol": [1, 1], "l": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_NEW_LARGE_L_MASTER", "r": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_NEW_LARGE_R_MASTER", "at": null, "front": "DAMAGE_HOOD_INT_HARD"}, {"mph": 100, "vol": [1, 1], "l": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_SUPER_HARD_L_MASTER", "r": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_SUPER_HARD_R_MASTER", "at": null, "front": "DAMAGE_HOOD_INT_HARD"}], "band3Max": 150, "spread": 2.5, "scrapeSpeed": [5, 60], "scrapePitch": [1.2, 2], "scrapeRate": 1}, "car_undercarriage": {"name": "PLAYER_CAR_COLLISION_UNDERCARRIAGE", "same": "car_side"}, "car_roof": {"name": "PLAYER_CAR_COLLISION_ROOF", "bands": [{"mph": 3, "vol": [0.75, 1], "l": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_NEW_ROOF_SMALL_MASTER_L", "r": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_NEW_ROOF_SMALL_MASTER_R", "at": null, "front": "DAMAGE_HOOD_INT_HARD"}, {"mph": 8, "vol": [1, 1], "l": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_NEW_ROOF_MED_MASTER_L", "r": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_NEW_ROOF_MED_MASTER_R", "at": null, "front": "DAMAGE_HOOD_INT_HARD"}, {"mph": 40, "vol": [1, 1], "l": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_NEW_ROOF_LARGE_MASTER_L", "r": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_NEW_ROOF_LARGE_MASTER_R", "at": null, "front": "DAMAGE_HOOD_INT_HARD"}, {"mph": 100, "vol": [1, 1], "l": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_SUPER_HARD_ROOF_MASTER_L", "r": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_SUPER_HARD_ROOF_MASTER_R", "at": null, "front": "DAMAGE_HOOD_INT_HARD"}], "band3Max": 150, "spread": 2.5, "scrapeSpeed": [2, 60], "scrapePitch": [1.2, 2], "scrapeRate": 1}, "car_wheel": {"name": "PLAYER_CAR_COLLISION_WHEEL", "bands": [{"mph": 3, "vol": [0.75, 1], "l": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_NEW_WHEEL_SMALL_MASTER_L", "r": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_NEW_WHEEL_SMALL_MASTER_R", "at": null, "front": "DAMAGE_HOOD_INT_HARD"}, {"mph": 8, "vol": [1, 1], "l": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_NEW_WHEEL_MED_MASTER_L", "r": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_NEW_WHEEL_MED_MASTER_R", "at": null, "front": "DAMAGE_HOOD_INT_HARD"}, {"mph": 40, "vol": [1, 1], "l": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_NEW_WHEEL_LARGE_MASTER_L", "r": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_NEW_WHEEL_LARGE_MASTER_R", "at": null, "front": "DAMAGE_HOOD_INT_HARD"}, {"mph": 100, "vol": [1, 1], "l": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_SUPER_HARD_WHEEL_MASTER_L", "r": "VEHICLE_BANGERS_SUPER_HARD_WHEEL_MASTER_R", "at": null, "front": "DAMAGE_HOOD_INT_HARD"}], "band3Max": 150, "spread": 2.5, "scrapeSpeed": [5, 60], "scrapePitch": [1.2, 2], "scrapeRate": 1}}, "partRule": "the car part material picks the set: car_undercarriage / car_roof / car_wheel their own, anything else car_side", "world": {"material": "MATERIALS_DEFAULT", "scrape": "SCRAPE_MASTER", "under": "SCRAPE_UNDER_MASTER", "physMaterials": ["car_roof", "car_side", "car_undercarriage", "car_wheel", "default", "exterior", "exterior_small", "ice", "interior_grass", "interior_road", "interior_sidewalk", "interior_small", "jump_down", "jump_up", "pothole", "prop", "puddles", "ragdoll", "reflector", "shortcut_grass", "shortcut_road", "shortcut_sidewalk", "shrub", "snow", "snow_reverb", "vertex", "wall", "wall_bush", "pedOnlyWalk", "pedOnlyStand", "prop_push_sphere", "pedRoad", "pedShortcut", "wallWood"], "allPairs": {"SCRAPE_MASTER | SCRAPE_UNDER_MASTER": ["MATERIALS_ALLEY", "MATERIALS_BRICK", "MATERIALS_COBBLESTONE", "MATERIALS_DEFAULT", "MATERIALS_DIRT", "MATERIALS_FWY", "MATERIALS_GRAVEL", "MATERIALS_INTERIOR", "MATERIALS_INTERIOR_MALL", "MATERIALS_MALL", "MATERIALS_MANHOLE", "MATERIALS_METAL", "MATERIALS_METAL_CORRUGATED", "MATERIALS_RAILROAD", "MATERIALS_ROAD", "MATERIALS_ROAD_BUMPY", "MATERIALS_SIDEWALK", "MATERIALS_STAIRS", "MATERIALS_TUNNEL", "MATERIALS_WALLSOUNDPASS"], "NULL_SOUND | NULL_SOUND": ["MATERIALS_DEATH", "MATERIALS_GRASS", "MATERIALS_RIVER", "MATERIALS_RIVERDEEP", "MATERIALS_SAND", "MATERIALS_SANDBEACH", "MATERIALS_WATER", "MATERIALS_WATER_DEEP"], "SCRAPE_MASTER | NULL_SOUND": ["MATERIALS_SEWER", "MATERIALS_WOOD"]}}, "impact": "per physics sub-step with a contact impulse: n = the contact normal from the car (the world-to-car normal negated), rel = car point velocity (world 0); contacts with n . normalize(rel) < 0.1 are scrape candidates (largest |rel|^2), others impact candidates (largest n . rel). mph = (n . rel) * 2.237; below band 0 mph: none. Band b covers [mph_b, mph_b+1): vol = lerp(vol[0], vol[1], (mph - mph_b) / (mph_b+1 - mph_b)); band 3 (from its mph): vol = mph >= band3Max ? vol[1] : vol[0] + (vol[1] - vol[0]) * (mph - band2.mph) / (band3Max - band3.mph) (as compiled), and at most once a frame (a second band-3 hit in the same frame returns before the scrape too). Code dB = vol >= 1e-5 ? log2(vol) * 0.301 * 20 : -100. Plays (code dB, 0 cents): at (NULL_SOUND in every set) at the point; front when the car z axis (matrix row 2) . n < -0.70711; l / r at the point +- spread/2 along x of the frame z = normalize(point in car space), x = normalize((0,1,0) x z) = normalize(z.z, 0, -z.x) (l = +, r = -); front / l / r ride along with the car (each update their position += the car's last-frame displacement)", "scrape": "speed = sqrt(max |rel|^2) * 0.447 (as compiled, m/s * 0.447); needs the world audio material (scrape / under not NULL) and speed >= scrapeSpeed[0]. dt9 = clock - lastScrapeTime (clock += frame dt once a frame); t = (speed - s0) / (s1 - s0), pitch ratio = clamp(lerp(scrapePitch, t)), cents = trunc(log10(pr) * 3.321928 * 1200); the point in car space: new when no voice, else moved toward the new one by min(dt9 * scrapeRate, 1). Sound: car up (row 1) . n >= -0.70711 -> world.scrape, else world.under. A voice playing the other sound is stopped; a live voice gets set(0 dB, cents), else a new one plays (0 dB, cents) at the car-space point through the car's current matrix. Each entity update: no scrape for >= 2 frames -> stop. Stopping SCRAPE_MASTER = its OnStop: the leaves are killed and the onStop sound (SCRAPE_CAR_DEBRIS) plays where the scrape voice is (stopKeepsPos)", "notes": "sound.js:917-1006: candidates sound.js:931-947, impact sound.js:953-984, scrape sound.js:988-1005; frame stop sound.js:1011-1015; ride-along sound.js:685-687; onStop where the voice is sound.js:403"}, "camera": {"snd": "CAMERA_CHANGES_MASTER", "pos": "none: speaker masks (FIN_LEFT FL, FIN_RIGHT FR)", "rule": "cameraChange(v): plays the sound (0 dB) when running, then the camera mix of view v", "notes": "sound.js:624-627"}, "notStock": {"turbo": "TUNERS_TURBO level 0 whine NULL; intake byte 0: no AIR_INTAKE_LOOP", "nitrous": "nitrous byte 0: not resolved (sound.js would still play TUNERS_NITRO level 0 NITROUS_FIRE_MASTER if s.nitrous went true; a stock car has none)", "notes": "sound.js:848-869; sound.js:1019-1029"}, "mix": {"views": {"0": "bumper", "1": "pov (cockpit)", "2": "boom1", "3": "boom2", "4": "boom3 (default view)", "5": "special (speed mix A = B = 0)", "6": "special", "other": "no camera slot: 0 dB"}, "slots": "view 0 -> slot 0 (bike 1), 1 -> 2 (bike 3), 2..6 -> 4..8, other -> none", "bike": false, "options": {"SFX": 1, "MUSIC": 1, "SPEECH": 1, "PLAYER_VEHICLES": 1, "CUTSCENES": 1}, "cats": {"BASE": {"dB": -12, "pitch": 0, "lpf": 23900, "hpf": 0, "rolloff": 5, "chain": [["BASE", -12]], "cam": [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]}, "CAR_BANGERS": {"dB": -31.5, "pitch": 0, "lpf": 23900, "hpf": 0, "rolloff": 10, "chain": [["CAR_BANGERS", 5.5], ["SFX_HARD", 0], ["SFX", -25], ["BASE", -12]], "cam": [0, 1.5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]}, "CAR_BANGERS_SCRAPE": {"dB": -15.5, "pitch": 0, "lpf": 23900, "hpf": 0, "rolloff": 10, "chain": [["CAR_BANGERS_SCRAPE", 16], ["CAR_BANGERS", 5.5], ["SFX_HARD", 0], ["SFX", -25], ["BASE", -12]], "cam": [0, 2.5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], "camLpf": [23900, 20000, 23900, 23900, 23900, 23900, 23900]}, "CAR_BANGERS_SUPER_HARD": {"dB": -32.5, "pitch": 0, "lpf": 23900, "hpf": 0, "rolloff": 10, "chain": [["CAR_BANGERS_SUPER_HARD", -1], ["CAR_BANGERS", 5.5], ["SFX_HARD", 0], ["SFX", -25], ["BASE", -12]], "cam": [0, 1.5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]}, "PLAYER_VEHICLES_BACKFIRE": {"dB": -46.5, "pitch": 0, "lpf": 23900, "hpf": 0, "rolloff": 5, "chain": [["PLAYER_VEHICLES_BACKFIRE", -26.5], ["PLAYER_VEHICLES", -8], ["BASE", -12]], "cam": [-100, -100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]}, "PLAYER_VEHICLES_ENGINES": {"dB": -25, "pitch": 0, "lpf": 23900, "hpf": 0, "rolloff": 12.5, "chain": [["PLAYER_VEHICLES_ENGINES", -5], ["PLAYER_VEHICLES", -8], ["BASE", -12]], "cam": [3.5, 4, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3], "camLpf": [23900, 15500, 23900, 23900, 23900, 23900, 23900], "speed": ["PLAYER_VEHICLES_ENGINES"]}, "PLAYER_VEHICLES_ENGINES_REVERSE": {"dB": -31.5, "pitch": 0, "lpf": 20000, "hpf": 0, "rolloff": 12.5, "chain": [["PLAYER_VEHICLES_ENGINES_REVERSE", -6.5], ["PLAYER_VEHICLES_ENGINES", -5], ["PLAYER_VEHICLES", -8], ["BASE", -12]], "cam": [3.5, 4, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3], "camLpf": [15000, 15000, 20000, 20000, 20000, 20000, 20000], "speed": ["PLAYER_VEHICLES_ENGINES"]}, "PLAYER_VEHICLES_GEARS": {"dB": -26.5, "pitch": 300, "lpf": 20000, "hpf": 0, "rolloff": 5, "chain": [["PLAYER_VEHICLES_GEARS", -6.5], ["PLAYER_VEHICLES", -8], ["BASE", -12]], "cam": [-1.5, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], "speed": ["PLAYER_VEHICLES_GEARS"]}, "PLAYER_VEHICLES_HOOD_INT": {"dB": -30, "pitch": 0, "lpf": 23900, "hpf": 0, "rolloff": 5, "chain": [["PLAYER_VEHICLES_HOOD_INT", -10], ["PLAYER_VEHICLES_DAMAGE_PART", 0], ["PLAYER_VEHICLES", -8], ["BASE", -12]], "cam": [-100, 0, -100, -100, -100, -100, -100]}, "PLAYER_VEHICLES_HORNS": {"dB": -3, "pitch": 0, "lpf": 23900, "hpf": 100, "rolloff": 5, "chain": [["PLAYER_VEHICLES_HORNS", 17], ["PLAYER_VEHICLES", -8], ["BASE", -12]], "cam": [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], "camLpf": [23900, 15000, 23900, 23900, 23900, 23900, 23900]}, "TERRAINS_PLAYER_ROLL_FILTERED": {"dB": -19, "pitch": 0, "lpf": 14000, "hpf": 0, "rolloff": 10, "chain": [["TERRAINS_PLAYER_ROLL_FILTERED", 0], ["TERRAINS_PLAYER_ROLL", 43], ["TERRAINS", -25], ["SFX_HARD", 0], ["SFX", -25], ["BASE", -12]], "cam": [-3, 2, -4, -4, -4, 0, 0], "speed": ["TERRAINS_PLAYER_ROLL", "TERRAINS"]}, "TERRAINS_PLAYER_SKIDS": {"dB": -23, "pitch": 0, "lpf": 23900, "hpf": 0, "rolloff": 10, "chain": [["TERRAINS_PLAYER_SKIDS", 39], ["TERRAINS", -25], ["SFX_HARD", 0], ["SFX", -25], ["BASE", -12]], "cam": [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], "camLpf": [23900, 17500, 23900, 23900, 23900, 23900, 23900], "speed": ["TERRAINS_PLAYER_SKIDS", "TERRAINS"]}, "UI": {"dB": -29, "pitch": 0, "lpf": 23900, "hpf": 0, "rolloff": 5, "chain": [["UI", 8], ["FRONT_END", 0], ["SFX", -25], ["BASE", -12]], "cam": [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]}}, "speed": {"PLAYER_VEHICLES_ENGINES": {"a": [0, 100], "b": [0, 0.75], "belowDb": 1, "aboveDb": 0, "rate": 6}, "PLAYER_VEHICLES_GEARS": {"a": [0, 100], "b": [1, 0.75], "belowDb": 0, "aboveDb": 7.5, "rate": 6}, "TERRAINS_PLAYER_ROLL": {"a": [0, 75], "b": [0, 0.75], "belowDb": -4.5, "aboveDb": 0, "rate": 6}, "TERRAINS": {"a": [0, 100], "b": [0, 0.75], "belowDb": 0, "aboveDb": 3, "rate": 6}, "TERRAINS_PLAYER_SKIDS": {"a": [0, 100], "b": [0, 0.75], "belowDb": -3, "aboveDb": 0, "rate": 6}}, "rule": "category dB = cats[c].dB (static: option volumes 1.0, no camera slot, speed controllers 0 dB) + cats[c].cam[view] + sum over cats[c].speed of that controller's current dB; pitch cents = cats[c].pitch. Speed controller (once per frame): A = speed m/s * 2.237 (mph), B = (rpm - idle) / (max - idle); view 5: A = B = 0. Target: A <= a[0] and B <= b[0] -> belowDb; A >= a[1] or B >= b[1] -> aboveDb; else belowDb + max((A - a[0]) / (a[1] - a[0]), B - b[0] / b[1] - b[0]) * (aboveDb - belowDb) (the second term as compiled: B - (b[0]/b[1]) - b[0]). The controller dB starts at 0 and moves to the target at rate dB/s (linear, no overshoot). chain = the categories whose own volume adds up (each [name, own dB]); cam / camLpf / camHpf per view 0..6", "notes": "options sound.js:471; camera sound.js:482-491; speed sound.js:498-511, called sound.js:662; tree sound.js:517-538; voice level sound.js:360-367"}, "levels": {"conv": {"dB2lin": "d >= -100 ? 10^(d/20) : 0", "lin2dB": "v >= 1e-5 ? 20*log10(v) : -100", "cents": "ratio = 2^(cents/1200)", "randInt": "a + floor(rand * (b - a + 1)) (inclusive; header randoms are randInt(-var, var) in mB / cents / ms)", "randF": "a + rand * (b - a)", "approach": "v moves toward target by rate*dt, clamped at the target"}, "voice": "leaf voice dB = leaf.dB + leaf randoms (dBr own, r shared rolls) + lin2dB(twin / envelope gain) + the code dB of play()/set() - waves[w].headroomDb + category dB (mix) + distance dB; cents = leaf.c + randoms + code cents + category pitch; linear gain = dB2lin(dB), rate ratio = 2^(cents/1200). Output to the destination with no master gain (option volumes 1.0). An OnStop sound (stop.def) adds stop.dB / stop.c (+ stop.r rolls, the same values as the main sound rolled) to its leaves", "leafKeys": "n name, w wave key, dB, c cents, pd predelay ms, dBr / cr / pdr own random +- (randInt), r shared roll ids (rolls[i] = [dB+-, cents+-, predelay ms+-], rolled once per play), st header start [value, +-var, 1 = % of the wave / 0 = ms], cat category, spk speaker mask (bits FL 1, FR 2, C 4, LFE 8, RL 16, RR 32: gains 1/sqrt(set bits) on FL FR RL RR; LFE-only (8) has no output in sound.js), ro distance scale (0: none), roc rolloff curve when not DEFAULT_ROLLOFF, when [[pick, option] ...] plays only if those picks chose those options, tw [twin, slot], env envelope id (gain on the leaf), lp looping-sound id, so \"rel\" = on stop it fades by its envelope release (else killed at once)", "defKeys": "leaves, picks [{n, hist, wt weights, opt child names, when}] (evaluate in order; a pick runs only when its own when holds; weighted randF pick, children among the last hist picks excluded when hist > 0 and n > hist; the history is per pick NAME and global, shared by every sound using that node), rolls, tw [{swap ms [min, max], xf ms [min, max], curve, lin}], env [{a ms, d ms, s %, hold ms (-1 forever), rel ms (-1 none), ca/cd/cr curves, pd: the envelope's own delay}], loop [{count -1 = forever}: when every leaf of the loop has ended and the sound is not stopping, they are played again (rolled again)], stop {at, dB, c, r, when, def}, ignored (what sound.js skips)", "start": "start: hdr = st[2] ? st[0]+-st[1] % * dur : st[0]+-st[1] ms; code = play start % * dur; pre = max(predelay sum, 0); code < pre -> delay = pre - code, offset = hdr; else delay 0, offset = code - pre + hdr; offset clamped to [0, dur]. Looping waves (loopStart >= 0) loop [loopStart, end]", "envelope": "gain: t = now - start - env.pd (ms); t < 0: 0; t < a: curveRange(ca, 0, 1, 0, a, t); t < a + d: curveRange(cd, s/100, 1, a, a + d, t); else s/100; hold >= 0 and t > a + d + hold: release from s/100 to 0 over rel ms by cr (rel < 0: stays at s/100), then the leaves stop. Stop with rel >= 0 starts the release", "distance": "positioned voices only (sections say pos): scale = leaf.ro; d = distance listener -> source (m); x = scale >= 1 ? (d < 5 ? d : 5 + (d - 5) / scale) : d / scale; dB = x < 4.99 ? 0 : x >= 128 ? -100 : poly(t), t = (x - 63.95) * 0.027052762; type 14 curves (roc): max(dB, floor) (minus floor when sub)", "poly": [-62.4395, -17.0421, 4.3724, -2.5018, 0.715, 0.9942, -0.2507, -0.5388, 0.2201], "pan": "rel = source in listener space (x right, y up, z forward); d = normalize(rel.x, 0, rel.z), n = normalize(rel) ((1,0,0) when |v|^2 <= 1e-5), e = d.n, h = (1 - e)/2; C = 0.70711; FL = max(0, C(dz - dx)) e + h, FR = max(0, C(dx + dz)) e + h, RL = max(0, -C(dx + dz)) e + h, RR = max(0, C(dx - dz)) e + h; stereo fold L = FL + C*RL, R = FR + C*RR. Unpositioned voices (engine bus, OnStop sounds) go to both channels at full gain (a mono WebAudio source on a stereo destination)", "curves": {"DEFAULT_BANGER_CLAMP": {"t": 14, "clamp": false, "min": 0, "max": 1, "floor": -6, "sub": false}, "DEFAULT_ROLLOFF": {"t": 13, "clamp": false, "min"